            <ArticleTitle>Stenting the undeployed stent.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>667-71</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Undeployment of a stent which poses a potential risk for future events may become a serious problem in the catheter laboratory. Herewith, we present a case in which we successfully stented an undeployed stent in the distal right coronary artery.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
